    "name": "Orbs of Chaos",
    "steam_appid": 2860270,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860270/extras/f7f345914dd5da80c7d2cff1b44ac53a.avif?t=1727105014\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><br>Orbs of Chaos is a <strong>horde survivor action rogue-lite</strong> where you wield unholy orbs to cast powerful spells and defeat endless waves of enemies.<br><br>Each run lasts <strong>21 minutes</strong>, during which you face <strong>7 challenging bullet hell inspired bosses</strong> and thousands of enemies. <br><br>With 10 different starting spell sets, various items, talents, levels, and randomized enemy encounters, no two playthroughs are ever the same!<br><br><i>Become the Caster herself in the twisted Realm of Despair and embark on a journey of hatred.</i><br><br><strong>Orb Combination</strong><br><br>Before each run, you pick 3 out of 5 available orbs. During the run, you can combine these orbs to cast any of the 10 possible spells they create.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860270/extras/1add85117a5a400dcf407fb5f702ce7a.poster.avif?t=1727105014\" width=400 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860270/extras/1add85117a5a400dcf407fb5f702ce7a.webm?t=1727105014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860270/extras/1add85117a5a400dcf407fb5f702ce7a.mp4?t=1727105014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> <br><strong>Corruption Tree</strong><br><br>Earn Chaos Shards by killing bosses and spend them to corrupt yourself, gaining powerful permanent talents while making the Chaos stronger.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860270/extras/89ce75319a0f752bedad6c8fc95acfa0.poster.avif?t=1727105014\" width=592 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860270/extras/89ce75319a0f752bedad6c8fc95acfa0.webm?t=1727105014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860270/extras/89ce75319a0f752bedad6c8fc95acfa0.mp4?t=1727105014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>Maybe you noticed that the font is different between those two GIFs. You can change the font.</i><br><br><strong>Current Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Chaos Mode:</strong> Customize game settings and access the overleveled spells. Push the limits, practice, and unleash chaos.<br></li><li> <strong>Corruption Tree:</strong> 20 permanent talents that make you even more lethal. <i>(Talent number is currently rising and will be updated.)</i><br></li><li> <strong>35 Powerful Spells:</strong> Combinations of Chaos unlock 35 unique spells in total. Some talents affect the outcomes of certain spells.<br></li><li> <strong>5 Unique Orbs:</strong> 5 orbs mean 10 starting combinations, similar to having 10 different classes. Other than contributing to spells, each orb also has special auto-shooting abilities like knockback, life steal, and bouncing.<br></li><li> Secrets with their own enemies and bosses.<br></li><li> 7+ unique bosses.<br></li><li> 20+ unique items to be stronger in a different way each run.<br></li><li> 10+ unique enemy types, and they all spawn with a weakness towards an orb that the player has.<br></li><li> Music coming straight from the Chaos for each minute and for each boss, increasing energy/stress/anxiety constantly. <br></li><li> All hand-drawn retro pixel art. Thanks to Dad for drawing almost every artwork.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860270/extras/f7f345914dd5da80c7d2cff1b44ac53a.avif?t=1727105014\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><br>Orbs of Chaos is a <strong>horde survivor action rogue-lite</strong> where you wield unholy orbs to cast powerful spells and defeat endless waves of enemies.<br><br>Each run lasts <strong>21 minutes</strong>, during which you face <strong>7 challenging bullet hell inspired bosses</strong> and thousands of enemies. <br><br>With 10 different starting spell sets, various items, talents, levels, and randomized enemy encounters, no two playthroughs are ever the same!<br><br><i>Become the Caster herself in the twisted Realm of Despair and embark on a journey of hatred.</i><br><br><strong>Orb Combination</strong><br><br>Before each run, you pick 3 out of 5 available orbs. During the run, you can combine these orbs to cast any of the 10 possible spells they create.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860270/extras/1add85117a5a400dcf407fb5f702ce7a.poster.avif?t=1727105014\" width=400 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860270/extras/1add85117a5a400dcf407fb5f702ce7a.webm?t=1727105014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860270/extras/1add85117a5a400dcf407fb5f702ce7a.mp4?t=1727105014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> <br><strong>Corruption Tree</strong><br><br>Earn Chaos Shards by killing bosses and spend them to corrupt yourself, gaining powerful permanent talents while making the Chaos stronger.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860270/extras/89ce75319a0f752bedad6c8fc95acfa0.poster.avif?t=1727105014\" width=592 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860270/extras/89ce75319a0f752bedad6c8fc95acfa0.webm?t=1727105014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860270/extras/89ce75319a0f752bedad6c8fc95acfa0.mp4?t=1727105014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>Maybe you noticed that the font is different between those two GIFs. You can change the font.</i><br><br><strong>Current Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Chaos Mode:</strong> Customize game settings and access the overleveled spells. Push the limits, practice, and unleash chaos.<br></li><li> <strong>Corruption Tree:</strong> 20 permanent talents that make you even more lethal. <i>(Talent number is currently rising and will be updated.)</i><br></li><li> <strong>35 Powerful Spells:</strong> Combinations of Chaos unlock 35 unique spells in total. Some talents affect the outcomes of certain spells.<br></li><li> <strong>5 Unique Orbs:</strong> 5 orbs mean 10 starting combinations, similar to having 10 different classes. Other than contributing to spells, each orb also has special auto-shooting abilities like knockback, life steal, and bouncing.<br></li><li> Secrets with their own enemies and bosses.<br></li><li> 7+ unique bosses.<br></li><li> 20+ unique items to be stronger in a different way each run.<br></li><li> 10+ unique enemy types, and they all spawn with a weakness towards an orb that the player has.<br></li><li> Music coming straight from the Chaos for each minute and for each boss, increasing energy/stress/anxiety constantly. <br></li><li> All hand-drawn retro pixel art. Thanks to Dad for drawing almost every artwork.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Harness the Orbs of Chaos! Choose 3 orbs each run to create 10 overpowered spells in real time in this noisy action roguelite. Slay Lovecraftian horrors and face deadly bosses every 3 minutes. Embrace the Chaos and uncover the unholy secrets of a grotesque world, all set to a haunting soundtrack.",
